TECHNIQUE FILE - THE PUPPET ARTS (SASORI)
"Sasori of the Red Sand." Master puppeteer of the Hidden Sand, human-puppet maker.

- Puppet mastery: Sasori manipulates puppets by chakra threads, wielding many at once
  where lesser puppeteers manage one. His puppets bristle with blades, flamethrowers,
  and poison-tipped mechanisms.
- Human puppets: he converts human corpses into puppets that retain their chakra and
  jutsu. His prize is "Hiruko," a puppet-shell he wears as armour, and the converted
  body of the Third Kazekage, granting him that Kage's Iron Sand.
- Self-conversion: Sasori remade his own body into a puppet, leaving only a living
  "core" in the chest. He does not age and feels no pain from a puppet's wounds; only
  the core is vulnerable.
- Poison: nearly every blade he uses carries a fast, agonising poison for which few
  hold an antidote. A single graze can end an opponent.
- Ultimate: "Red Secret Technique - Performance of a Hundred Puppets," commanding an
  army of puppet bodies at once.

Strike the living core in the chest. Everything else is replaceable wood and steel.
